  message: "Bakeoff validation complete (deep-20260407-030917 kserve reflect agent): 359/361 (99.4%) library_pattern method calls in kserve hg.json now carry correct access_mode. Counts by pattern: get->read 124, append->write 98, read->read 42, update->mutate 36, write->write 30, extend->write 11, remove->delete 7, add->write 5, pop->delete 3, setdefault->read 2. Overall Python edges 3782 read / 2270 write / 39 mutate / 10 delete vs 14595 none = ~29% access_mode coverage, matching the 32.71% access_mode_coverage metric (+1.01pp over deep-20260406-233120). dimension_scores.dataflow_annotation_quality = 4/5. PR iterabloom/hypergumbo#2740 (commit b5680c151)."  # fe67
